  giverName: "Duvarc\u0131 Halil"
  giverPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  giverLines:
  - "Har\xE7 i\xE7in s\xF6nm\xFC\u015F kire\xE7 laz\u0131m. Kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131
    var ama. Ustan ta\u015Ftan kire\xE7 \xE7\u0131kar\u0131rd\u0131, iki ad\u0131mda.
    Acele etme."
  deliveryLines:
  - "Tam k\u0131vam\u0131nda. \xC7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131 ustas\u0131n\u0131 aratm\u0131yor."
  hintText: "Her denklem katsay\u0131 istemez. Saymadan kavanoz ekleme."
  realLifeText: "Kire\xE7 s\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCl\xFCrken \xE7ok \u0131s\u0131 \xE7\u0131kar
    ve kire\xE7 cilde, g\xF6ze zarar verir; ustalar eldiven ve g\xF6zl\xFCk takar."
